Package: ceilidh
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6, libasound2 | libasound2t64, libdrm2, libgbm1, python3 (>= 3.13), python3 (<< 3.14)
Recommends: ffmpeg
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: Two pad dance mat game with custom song support
 Ceilidh is a dance mat game for a pair of dance pads, built for Konami
 Xbox 360 pads but happy with anything SDL can see. It reads StepMania
 simfiles, plays background videos, and can generate charts from audio.
 .
 It ships a kiosk service so a Raspberry Pi can boot straight into an
 attract loop with no desktop underneath it.
